From d7c3ff1d3abebbcb3098276d680f551867a7dc1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:52:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(pg): add a configurable limit to find_slow_queries

findSlowQueries always returned the top 20 statements. Add
findSlowQueries(int limit), clamped to 1..100 with 20 as the default,
an optional limit argument on the find_slow_queries tool and a --limit
option on jvm-mcp pg --action slow-queries.

Fixes #175
